{"b":64,"c":1,"v":{"1":["The elder to Gaius the beloved, whom I love in truth!","Beloved, I desire you to prosper concerning all things, and to be in health, even as your soul prospers,","for I rejoiced exceedingly, brothers coming and testifying of the truth in you, even as you walk in truth;","I have no joy greater than these things, that I may hear of my children walking in truth.","Beloved, you act faithfully in whatever you may do toward the brothers and the one [among] strangers,","who testified of your love before an assembly, whom you will do well, having sent forward worthily of God,","because they went forth for [His] Name, receiving nothing from the nations;","we, then, ought to receive such, that we may become fellow-workers to the truth.","I wrote to the assembly, but he who is loving to be first among them—Diotrephes—does not receive us;","because of this, if I may come, I will cause him to remember his works that he does, talking nonsense against us with evil words; and not content with these, neither does he himself receive the brothers, and he forbids those intending [to receive them], and he casts [them] out of the assembly.","Beloved, do not be following that which is evil, but that which is good; he who is doing good, he is of God, [but] he who is doing evil has not seen God;","testimony has been given to Demetrius by all, and by the truth itself, and we also—we testify, and you have known that our testimony is true.","Many things I had to write, but I do not wish to write to you through ink and pen,","and I hope to see you soon, and we will speak mouth to mouth. Peace to you! The friends greet you. Be greeting the friends by name.","-"]},"w":{"1":[[{"t":"The elder","s":"G4245","m":"A-NSM-C","g":"πρεσβυτερος"},{"t":"to","s":"G27","m":"A-DSM","g":"αγαπητω"},{"t":"Gaius","s":"G1050","m":"N-DSM","g":"γαιω"},{"t":"the beloved,","s":"G27","m":"A-DSM","g":"αγαπητω"},{"t":"whom","s":"G3739","m":"R-ASM","g":"ον"},{"t":"I","s":"G1473","m":"P-1NS","g":"εγω